OL,3,GNEWSATown centre 'mobbed' as half
OL,4,Amarathon returns
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthampton town centre was "mobbed" by
OL,7,Fspectators who came out in force during
OL,8,Frain showers to support runners taking
OL,9,Fpart in an annual half marathon.
OL,11,FSimon Howell, the event director of the
OL,12,FAmazing Northampton Run, said it would
OL,13,Freturn next year after its hugely
OL,14,Fsuccessful fourth event.
OL,16,F"If the plan was to promote Northampton
OL,17,Fand make people happy, yes, we did it,"
OL,18,Fhe said.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
