OL,3,GNEWSATown centre 'mobbed' as half
OL,4,Amarathon returns
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was a fantastic turnout; so many
OL,7,Fpeople watched - about a 1,000 -
OL,8,Feveryone got involved, it was
OL,9,Fincredible."
